WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:03,460
Queen, don't be angry

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:05,460
I think it's a good thing

3
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,810
My grandma ate all her energy boxes

4
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:09,810
Do you think I'm angry?

5
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:11,970
Although she ate the treasure

6
00:00:11,970 --> 00:00:13,970
But he will also do his best for us.

7
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:15,970
This guy is strong

8
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:17,970
It will definitely change the pattern of the Holy Land

9
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:20,130
Are you worried about running out of resources by then?

10
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:22,130
Go, hurry to the Holy Land

11
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:27,780
Don't waste a breath

12
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:30,480
My grandma’s energy box

13
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:32,480
It's right up front, there are a lot of resources in there

14
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:34,800
What resources

15
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,800
Strange number of flowers and plants

16
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,800
And meat worms

17
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:40,800
What kind of power do fleshworms have?

18
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:42,800
There is no grade, the big ones can reach the sixth grade

19
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,800
It is easy to absorb after eating those flowers and plants

20
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:47,120
The quantity is still large

21
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,120
All nine Zerg elites are inside

22
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,470
Of course, this is the place where all ethnic groups compete.

23
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:53,470
Other tribes also have old and miserable wine like yours.

24
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:55,470
What is old and miserable?

25
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:57,470
Back then I killed all races

26
00:00:57,470 --> 00:00:59,470
Without blinking an eye

27
00:00:59,470 --> 00:01:02,180
Our Tang Lang never blinks in the first place.

28
00:01:02,180 --> 00:01:04,180
Did I mean the eyes?

29
00:01:04,180 --> 00:01:06,180
I'm talking about the momentum of a broadsword.

30
00:01:06,180 --> 00:01:08,270
Is yours really big?

31
00:01:08,270 --> 00:01:10,270
You are big, you are good, right?

32
00:01:10,270 --> 00:01:15,020
Arrived, dropped

33
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:17,020
Enter through the gap between rocks

34
00:01:17,020 --> 00:01:19,020
Don't be swept away by the whirlwind above
